WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,330 --> 00:00:08,770
Haven't left yet

2
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:10,770
What should I do, senior?

3
00:00:10,770 --> 00:00:11,770
If you can't get out

4
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:12,770
How can we find resources?

5
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:14,770
I'll take a look later

6
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:20,130
So you can do me a favor

7
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:26,300
Come on, help me cut open this straw mat.

8
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:38,300
It should be about the same width as my forearm.

9
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:39,580
I'll throw a wooden block out in a moment

10
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,580
Then you open the door

11
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:42,580
Just a wolf comes in

12
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,580
Just close the door immediately and remember

13
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:46,580
If one comes in, close the door immediately.

14
00:00:46,580 --> 00:01:11,170
I don't have the confidence to handle two of them and open the door.

15
00:01:11,170 --> 00:01:12,170
A wolf comes in
